(text "RMX A0.2 / LEDS / DRAFT - common-cathode display, 1k per lit segment, 3.3V HC logic" (at 15 13 0) (effects (font (size 1.6 1.6)) (justify left)) (uuid d76463e7-6813-566a-9fa3-f9a0746ef6ee))
(text "U9 nearest MCU drives bits 0..7. Its Q7S feeds U10 DS. Clock/latch shared. OE pull-up keeps outputs dark through reset." (at 15 17 0) (effects (font (size 1.6 1.6)) (justify left)) (uuid 1f0895c9-e7c9-5c88-9f5a-e29f87e68c0b))
